-- Issue #9, the second half: `memo/Note.created(...)` creates an entity another
-- module declares, and `creating n: notes/Note` caught nothing, because the
-- qualified creation was never performed at all. The reaction to it is written
-- through the qualified name too.

journey PinNote {
    cast:
        b: Board
    1. pinning creates a note in another module
        b does Pin(b, "hello") on BoardPage
            creating n: notes/Note
        then n.text = "hello"
        then Notice fires
        then n.seen = true
}
